<view class="page-body">
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{forbidden}}">
    <text class="section-title">{{forbidden.title}}</text>
    <text class="muted">{{forbidden.text}}</text>
  </view>
  <block wx:if="{{!forbidden}}">
  <view class="empty-text" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="onRetry">
    <text class="muted">{{error}}</text>
    <text class="link"> 点此重试</text>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
    <view class="card">
      <text class="section-title">服务类型模板</text>
      <view class="service-row" wx:for="{{form.services}}" wx:key="code">
        <view class="row between">
          <text class="muted">{{item.code}}</text>
        </view>
        <input class="form-input" value="{{item.name}}" maxlength="{{limits.serviceNameMax}}" placeholder="服务名称" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="name" bindinput="onServiceInput" />
        <input class="form-input" value="{{item.desc}}" maxlength="{{limits.serviceDescMax}}" placeholder="服务说明" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="desc" bindinput="onServiceInput" />
      </view>
      <view class="small">服务类型只描述“做什么”，不含任何计价字段；固定 5 类（标准代取/送至楼下/加急代取/代寄快递/其他代办），只能改名称与说明，不新增/不删除。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="section-title">苑名</text>
      <view class="form-row" wx:for="{{form.zones}}" wx:key="key">
        <text class="form-label">{{item.key}}</text>
        <input class="form-input" value="{{item.value}}" maxlength="10" placeholder="{{item.placeHolder}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="onZoneInput" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="section-title">站点配置（顺序 / 别名 / 取件码格式）</text>
      <view class="row between toggle-row">
        <text class="muted">从截图识别站点</text>
        <switch checked="{{form.stationInfer.fromImage}}" color="#1F7A5C" data-field="fromImage" bindchange="onStationInferToggle" />
      </view>
      <view class="row between toggle-row">
        <text class="muted">从取件码推断站点</text>
        <switch checked="{{form.stationInfer.fromCode}}" color="#1F7A5C" data-field="fromCode" bindchange="onStationInferToggle" />
      </view>
      <view class="station-row" wx:for="{{form.stations}}" wx:key="id" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onStationOpen">
        <view class="station-main">
          <text class="station-no">{{item.id}}</text>
          <view class="station-info">
            <text class="station-name">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="station-sub">{{item.aliasCount}} 个别名 · {{item.patternCount}} 个取件码格式</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="station-ops">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost mini-btn" size="mini" data-index="{{index}}" data-dir="-1" disabled="{{index === 0}}" catchtap="onStationMove">上移</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost mini-btn" size="mini" data-index="{{index}}" data-dir="1" disabled="{{index === form.stations.length - 1}}" catchtap="onStationMove">下移</button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="small">点站点行编辑名称/别名/取件码格式；上下移动决定展示顺序（顾客端选择器与兼职端分组按此顺序）。站点编号固定 P1~P8，不能自建/删除；别名仅用于识别与手输归一、不展示，兼职端仍按主站点归类；取件码格式中 `*` 代表任意字母数字（如 *-*-**** 命中 64-4-4033）。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="sheet-mask" wx:if="{{sheet.open}}" catchtap="onSheetClose" catchtouchmove="onSheetNoop">
      <view class="sheet" catchtap="onSheetNoop">
        <view class="sheet-head">
          <text class="sheet-title">{{sheet.title}} 站点设置</text>
          <text class="sheet-pos">{{sheet.position}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sheet-field">
          <text class="sheet-label">名称</text>
          <input class="sheet-input" value="{{sheet.name}}" maxlength="{{limits.stationNameMax}}" placeholder="{{sheet.defaultName}}" data-index="{{sheet.index}}" bindinput="onStationInput" />
          <text class="sheet-help">1~20 字，不能与其他站点重复</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sheet-field">
          <view class="sheet-field-head">
            <text class="sheet-label">别名</text>
            <text class="sheet-count">{{sheet.aliasCount}}/5</text>
          </view>
          <input class="sheet-input" value="{{sheet.aliasesText}}" maxlength="{{stationLimits.aliasTextMax}}" data-index="{{sheet.index}}" placeholder="如 西苑一栋南面，多个用顿号或逗号分隔" bindinput="onStationAliasInput" />
          <text class="sheet-help">仅用于识别与手输归一；兼职端仍按主站点归类</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sheet-field">
          <view class="sheet-field-head">
            <text class="sheet-label">取件码格式</text>
            <text class="sheet-count">{{sheet.patternCount}}/3</text>
          </view>
          <input class="sheet-input" value="{{sheet.codePatternsText}}" maxlength="{{stationLimits.patternTextMax}}" data-index="{{sheet.index}}" placeholder="如 *-*-****，多个用顿号分隔" bindinput="onStationPatternInput" />
          <text class="sheet-help">`*` 代表任意字母数字、整串匹配；命中唯一站点时作为站点依据</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sheet-err" wx:if="{{sheet.error}}">{{sheet.error}}</view>
        <view class="sheet-actions">
          <view class="btn btn-ghost sheet-btn" bindtap="onSheetClose">取消</view>
          <view class="btn btn-primary sheet-btn" bindtap="onSheetConfirm">确定</view>
        </view>
        <view class="sheet-tip">「确定」只改本页草稿；点页面底部「保存配置」后才生效。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="section-title">公告</text>
      <view class="row between toggle-row">
        <text class="muted">启用公告</text>
        <switch checked="{{form.announcement.enabled}}" color="#1F7A5C" bindchange="onAnnouncementToggle" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">标题</text>
        <input class="form-input" value="{{form.announcement.title}}" maxlength="{{limits.announcementTitleMax}}" placeholder="公告标题" data-field="title" bindinput="onAnnouncementInput" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-block">
        <text class="form-label">正文</text>
        <textarea class="form-textarea" value="{{form.announcement.text}}" maxlength="{{limits.announcementTextMax}}" placeholder="公告正文" data-field="text" bindinput="onAnnouncementInput" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="section-title">时长与留存</text>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">接单超时</text>
        <input class="form-input" type="number" value="{{form.orderTimeoutMinutes}}" data-field="orderTimeoutMinutes" bindinput="onNumberInput" />
        <text class="muted">分钟</text>
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">自动完成时间</text>
        <input class="form-input" value="{{form.autoCompleteAt}}" maxlength="5" placeholder="HH:MM" data-field="autoCompleteAt" bindinput="onNumberInput" />
        <text class="muted">HH:MM</text>
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">截图留存</text>
        <input class="form-input" type="number" value="{{form.screenshotRetentionDays}}" data-field="screenshotRetentionDays" bindinput="onNumberInput" />
        <text class="muted">天</text>
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">识别失败留存</text>
        <input class="form-input" type="number" value="{{form.recognitionFailureRetentionDays}}" data-field="recognitionFailureRetentionDays" bindinput="onNumberInput" />
        <text class="muted">天</text>
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">切换会话</text>
        <input class="form-input" type="number" value="{{form.ttlMinutes}}" data-field="ttlMinutes" bindinput="onNumberInput" />
        <text class="muted">分钟</text>
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">头像上限</text>
        <input class="form-input" type="number" value="{{form.avatarMaxKb}}" data-field="avatarMaxKb" bindinput="onNumberInput" />
        <text class="muted">KB</text>
      </view>
      <view class="small">截图留存最多 7 天；识别失败留存 7~30 天；切换会话 5~60 分钟；头像大小上限 100~200KB；自动完成时间为 UTC+8 的 HH:MM（默认 22:00，每天该时刻自动完成送达单：该时刻前送达的当天完成，该时刻后送达的下一轮自动完成）。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="section-title">维护模式</text>
      <view class="row between toggle-row">
        <text class="muted">开启维护</text>
        <switch checked="{{form.maintenance.enabled}}" color="#E54D42" bindchange="onMaintenanceToggle" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="form-label">维护说明</text>
        <input class="form-input" value="{{form.maintenance.text}}" maxlength="{{limits.maintenanceTextMax}}" placeholder="维护说明" bindinput="onMaintenanceInput" />
      </view>
      <view class="small">开启后顾客/兼职端会看到维护公告，写操作被拒绝；后台不受影响。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="section-title">只读项</text>
      <view class="row between info-row">
        <text class="muted">智能识别兜底</text>
        <text>{{readonlyInfo.aiFallbackText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="row between info-row">
        <text class="muted">测试账号上限（每角色）</text>
        <text>{{readonlyInfo.testAccountMaxPerRole}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="row between info-row">
        <text class="muted">测试数据保留天数</text>
        <text>{{readonlyInfo.testDataRetentionDays}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="small">智能识别兜底与测试账号上限不在本页开放编辑；需要调整请联系部署侧。</view>    </view>

    <view class="btn btn-primary btn-block save-action" bindtap="onSave">{{saving ? '保存中…' : '保存配置'}}</view>
  </block>
  </block>
</view>
